       }
      }
     ],
     "style": "h2"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000009",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000002",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Qena, while often overshadowed by its neighbor "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000004",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000003"
       ],
       "text": "Luxor"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000005",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " in terms of tourist amenities, offers a range of dining options that provide a taste of local "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000007",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000006"
       ],
       "text": "Egyptian cuisine"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000008",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". Here’s an overview of what you can expect in terms of food and restaurants in Qena:"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000003",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
        "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/the-ultimate-luxor-day-tour/"
       },
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "/the-ultimate-luxor-day-tour",
       "newTab": false
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000006",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Egyptian_cuisine",
       "newTab": true
      }
     ],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000000e",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ],
       "text": "Local Egyptian Cuisine"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "The food scene in Qena, though modest, is a gateway to authentic Egyptian flavors."
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Local restaurants and cafes, especially around the downtown area and near the train station, serve traditional Egyptian dishes."
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Staples like fuul (fava bean stew) and kushari (a mix of pasta, rice, lentils, and tomato sauce) are widely available and offer a true taste of local food culture."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "number",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000012",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000000f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ],
       "text": "International Options"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000010",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "For those looking for a familiar taste, there are also places serving international cuisine like pizza."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000011",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "These options provide variety for travelers with different dietary preferences or those looking for a break from traditional Egyptian fare."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "number",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000016",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000013",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ],
       "text": "Dining at Hotels"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000014",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "If you choose to stay overnight in Qena, hotel dining can be a convenient option."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000015",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Hotels typically offer a mix of local and international dishes, catering to the tastes of their diverse guests."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "number",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000001a",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000017",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ],
       "text": "Street Food and Cafes"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000018",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Exploring the street food in Qena can be a delightful experience."
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000019",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Small eateries and cafes offer quick bites and snacks, perfect for on-the-go dining or a casual meal."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "number",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000001e",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ],
       "text": "Culinary Exploration"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "When dining in Qena, it’s an opportunity to explore and appreciate the simplicity and heartiness of Egyptian cuisine."
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "The city’s food scene, though not as extensive as larger tourist cities, still provides a charming and authentic culinary experience."
      }
     ],
     "level": 1,
     "listItem": "number",
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000020",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "In conclusion, while Qena may not be a major culinary destination, it offers a glimpse into the everyday eating habits of its residents, with a variety of options ranging from traditional Egyptian dishes to more familiar international fare. Dining here allows visitors to experience a more authentic and down-to-earth side of Egyptian cuisine."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000024",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000021",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Created On March 18, 2020"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000022",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "\n"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000023",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Updated On July, 2025"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
